## Next Steps
To enable analytics data collection:
1. Deploy the application to Vercel
2. Navigate to the Analytics section in the Vercel dashboard
3. Click "Enable" to start collecting analytics data
4. Analytics data will begin appearing within 24 hours after first deployment

